          "Create meaningful progression",
          "Improve quiz completion rates",
          "Foster healthy competition",
          "Build long-term learning habits"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "research",
    "num": "05",
    "label": "Research & discovery",
    "title": "Research was conducted by analyzing existing trivia platforms, studying user behavior, and identifying factors that contribute to user motivation.",
    "board": {
      "src": "assets/img/case-studies/lumora/06-research.webp",
      "width": 1320,
      "height": 1142
    },
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "cards",
        "items": [
          {
            "title": "Users Prefer Short Sessions",
            "text": "Users were more likely to engage with quizzes that could be completed within a few minutes."
          },
          {
            "title": "Progress Drives Motivation",
            "text": "Visible achievements and progress indicators encouraged continued participation."
          },
          {
            "title": "Competition Increases Retention",
            "text": "Leaderboards and rankings created a sense of achievement and encouraged repeat visits."
          },
          {
            "title": "Rewards Build Habits",
            "text": "Badges, points, streaks, and achievements increased user motivation over time."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "problem",
    "num": "06",
    "label": "Problem & solution",
    "title": "How might we create a learning platform that transforms knowledge acquisition into a rewarding and competitive experience while maintaining simplicity and accessibility?",
    "lead": "Lumora combines personalized learning paths, engaging trivia challenges, competitive rankings, and achievement systems into a unified mobile experience.",
